<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - Germany.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - Germany.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for Germany made by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development and published in its half-year economic outlook.</p>
<p>		     1996  1997  1998     1996	1997	1998</p>
<p>		     year  year  year    H1  H2    H1  H2    H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	   1.4   2.2   2.8   1.0  3.1  2.0  1.8  3.0  3.2</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct    1.0   1.2   1.1   1.1  0.0  1.8  1.3  1.1  1.0</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p> Current account -0.6   0.1   0.3  -0.7 -0.5  0.0  0.2  0.3  0.3</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Unemployment    10.3  11.1  10.9  10.1 10.5 11.2 11.0 10.9 10.8</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
